Marcus,

As promised, the one-pager is attached (YAGNI-overview-2026.pdf). Short answers to your two questions:

Pricing for three DCs: list is $4,500 per site per month, so $13,500/month for Reno, Columbus and Allentown on an annual term. We discount for multi-site commitments, but I'd rather earn that conversation with a pilot first. A single-site pilot is a flat $18,000 for 8 weeks, credited against the first year if you continue.

Fulcrum WMS: yes, native. We read waves and order lines from Fulcrum's event API and write task assignments back through its labor module. No CSV exports. Our Columbus-area 3PL customer runs Fulcrum 11.2; I'd want to confirm your version on the call.

Would a 45-minute discovery call on June 16 or 17 work? Happy to fit your calendar.

Jack

